  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Operating grant to the AMCU/NAO --FY2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Overall objective: Capacity development for the staff of the MFDP Team, MACs, and NSAs intended &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;to &lt;/span&gt;facilitate the implementation of the EU cooperation with Liberia and strengthen its impact and visibility while reinforcing the institutions and the partnership with the country.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Specific objectives:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. Strengthening capacities and capabilities of the MFDP Team (AMCU and NAO) within the MFDP to effectively programme, supervise, manage, monitor the implementation, disseminate and account for EU cooperation development projects and programmes in coordination with other development partners and in line with EU and Liberian priorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2. Long Term Technical Assistance to the MFDP is agreed and mobilised; and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3. The complete integration of the MFDP Team (ONAO+AMCU) is finalized&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
